#: wizard.ui:46
#, no-c-format
msgid "When files have finished being processed, they are saved based upon the <i>File Location</i>.  Information about the track should be used within that text.  There are eleven special words starting with a % that will be replaced with the corresponding track's information.  Each of the buttons below will insert its replacement word into the <i>File Location</i> where the cursor is.  Use at least one replacement string to make sure that the <i>File Location</i> is unique."
